────────────╯       ╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
╭│ help │──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Keys                                                                                                                                     │
│ Chords are typed in sequence (g then l). Digits before a motion repeat it (15j).                                                         │
│ Rebind in ~/.config/ytm-go/keymap.toml — this page follows your bindings.                                                                │
│                                                                                                                                          │
│ Playback                                                                                                                                 │
│   space            Play / pause                                                                                                          │
│   n                Next track                                                                                                            │
│   p                Previous track                                                                                                        │
│   .                Play a random track from the queue                                                                                    │
│   P                Play the focused list from the start                                                                                  │
│   C-r              Cycle repeat (off, all, one)                                                                                          │
│   C-s              Toggle shuffle                                                                                                        │
│   +                Volume up                                                                                                             │
│   -                Volume down                                                                                                           │
│   _                Mute                                                                                                                  │
│   >                Seek forward                                                                                                          │
│   <                Seek backward                                                                                                         │
│   ^                Restart track                                                                                                         │
│   l                Like / unlike current track                                                                                           │
│   D                Discovery mix                                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                          │
│ Navigation                                                                                                                               │
│   j, down, C-n     Move down                                                                                                             │
│   k, up, C-p       Move up                                                                                                               │
│   C-f, page_down   Page down                                                                                                             │
│   C-b, page_up     Page up                                                                                                               │
│   g g, home        Go to top (or row N with a count)                                                                                     │
│   G, end           Go to bottom (or row N with a count)                                                                                  │
│   enter            Select / open                                                                                                         │
│   tab              Focus next panel                                                                                                      │
│   S-tab            Focus previous panel                                                                                                  │
│   C-w h            Focus pane to the left                                                                                                │
│   C-w l            Focus pane to the right                                                                                               │
│   C-w w            Cycle pane focus                                                                                                      │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
